{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a complete premium Shopify Online Store 2.0 custom header section for SBL Farms from scratch.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Make the ENTIRE header fully customizable through the Shopify Theme Editor. Do not hard-code important design values. Every major element, size, spacing, color, position, visibility, link, and behavior must have editable settings.
    
    HEADER STRUCTURE:
    
    Desktop:
    [ SBL Farms Logo ] [ Plants ⌄ | Seeds ⌄ | Pots ⌄ | Services ⌄ | Gifting ⌄ | Blog | Contact ] [ Search Bar | Account | Wishlist | Cart ]
    
    Do NOT include Home.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    1. HEADER HEIGHT & GENERAL SETTINGS
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create separate editable settings for:
    
    Desktop:
    - Header height: 50px–140px
    - Default: 80px
    
    Tablet:
    - Header height: 50px–130px
    - Default: 70px
    
    Mobile:
    - Header height: 50px–100px
    - Default: 64px
    
    Also make editable:
    - Header background color
    - Header text color
    - Header hover color
    - Header icon color
    - Header active color
    - Header border color
    - Border thickness
    - Header shadow
    - Header top padding
    - Header bottom padding
    - Header left/right padding
    - Maximum content width
    - Header alignment
    - Overall header spacing
    
    The header height must actually change when the Theme Editor value is changed.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    2. LOGO
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Add an editable Shopify image picker for the SBL Farms logo.
    
    Settings:
    - Logo image
    - Logo link
    - Desktop logo width
    - Tablet logo width
    - Mobile logo width
    - Logo height/max-height
    - Logo spacing
    - Show/hide logo
    
    Preserve the original logo aspect ratio.
    
    Never stretch, crop, or distort the logo.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    3. MAIN NAVIGATION
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Navigation:
    
    Plants ⌄
    Seeds ⌄
    Pots ⌄
    Services ⌄
    Gifting ⌄
    Blog
    Contact
    
    Do NOT add Home.
    
    Make navigation fully editable:
    - Menu text color
    - Hover color
    - Active color
    - Font family
    - Font size
    - Font weight
    - Letter spacing
    - Text transform
    - Navigation gap
    - Vertical alignment
    - Navigation position
    - Menu item padding
    - Menu item spacing
    - Show/hide navigation
    
    Do NOT use pills, buttons, boxes, or backgrounds around navigation items.
    
    Use clean premium text navigation.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    4. DROPDOWN CHEVRON
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    For Plants, Seeds, Pots, Services and Gifting:
    
    Use a small elegant thin SVG chevron instead of the default ▼ character.
    
    Settings:
    - Chevron size
    - Chevron color
    - Chevron spacing
    - Animation speed
    - Chevron stroke width
    
    Behavior:
    - Closed = points downward
    - Open = rotates 180 degrees upward
    - Smooth rotation animation
    - Vertically aligned with menu text
    - Same chevron behavior on desktop, tablet and mobile
    
    Do not use a large arrow.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    5. PLANTS DROPDOWN
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create exactly 10 editable submenu blocks:
    
    1. Indoor Plants
    2. Outdoor Plants
    3. Flowering Plants
    4. Succulents
    5. Cacti
    6. Fruit Plants
    7. Herbs
    8. Air-Purifying Plants
    9. Bonsai Plants
    10. Climbers and Creepers
    
    Each item must have:
    - Editable label
    - Editable Shopify link/URL
    - Enable/disable setting
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    6. SEEDS DROPDOWN
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create exactly 10 editable submenu blocks:
    
    1. Vegetable Seeds
    2. Flower Seeds
    3. Herb Seeds
    4. Fruit Seeds
    5. Organic Seeds
    6. Microgreen Seeds
    7. Hybrid Seeds
    8. Flower Mix Seeds
    9. Lawn Grass Seeds
    10. Seasonal Seeds
    
    Each item must have:
    - Editable label
    - Editable Shopify link/URL
    - Enable/disable setting
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    7. POTS DROPDOWN
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create exactly 10 editable submenu blocks:
    
    1. Terracotta Pots
    2. Ceramic Pots
    3. Plastic Pots
    4. Hanging Planters
    5. Self-Watering Pots
    6. Grow Bags
    7. Window Planters
    8. Decorative Planters
    9. Seedling Trays
    10. Plant Stands
    
    Each item must have:
    - Editable label
    - Editable Shopify link/URL
    - Enable/disable setting
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    8. SERVICES DROPDOWN
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create exactly 10 editable submenu blocks:
    
    1. Landscaping
    2. Green Walls
    3. AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract)
    4. Plant Rental
    5. Indoor Plant Maintenance
    6. Outdoor Plant Maintenance
    7. Garden Maintenance
    8. Terrace Gardening
    9. Vertical Garden Installation
    10. Plant Consultation
    
    Each item must have:
    - Editable label
    - Editable Shopify link/URL
    - Enable/disable setting
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    9. GIFTING DROPDOWN
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Create exactly 10 editable submenu blocks:
    
    1. Corporate Gifting
    2. Bulk Gifting
    3. Plant Gifting
    4. Personalized Plant Gifts
    5. Employee Gifting
    6. Client Gifting
    7. Festive Plant Gifting
    8. Wedding Plant Gifting
    9. Ec
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};border-bottom:{{ block.settings.border_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};box-shadow:{% if block.settings.show_shadow %}0 4px 18px rgba(20,35,26,.09){% else %}none{% endif %};z-index:30;position:relative}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:{{ block.settings.max_width }}px;min-height:{{ block.settings.desktop_height }}px;margin:0 auto;padding:{{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;display:flex;align-items:{{ block.settings.alignment }};justify-content:space-between;gap:{{ block.settings.overall_spacing }}px;box-sizing:border-box}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand{display:flex;align-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;gap:{{ block.settings.logo_spacing }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.logo_width_desktop }}px;max-height:{{ block.settings.logo_max_height }}px;height:auto;object-fit:contain}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand-name{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{display:{% if block.settings.show_navigation %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %};align-items:center;justify-content:{{ block.settings.nav_position }};flex:1 1 auto;gap:{{ block.settings.nav_gap }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{position:relative}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{color:{{ block.settings.nav_color }};font-family:{{ block.settings.nav_font.family }},{{ block.settings.nav_font.fallback_families }};font-size:{{ block.settings.nav_font_size }}px;font-weight:{{ block.settings.nav_font_weight }};letter-spacing:{{ block.settings.letter_spacing }}px;text-transform:{{ block.settings.text_transform }};text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:{{ block.settings.chevron_spacing }}px;border:0;padding:{{ block.settings.item_padding }}px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{display:inline-block;padding:{{ block.settings.item_padding }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger:hover,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link:hover{color:{{ block.settings.hover_color }}}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__chevron{width:{{ block.settings.chevron_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.chevron_size }}px;color:{{ block.settings.chevron_color }};transition:transform {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}ms ease;flex:0 0 auto}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger[aria-expanded=true] .sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__chevron,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item.is-open .sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;min-width:230px;padding:12px;background:{{ block.settings.dropdown_background }};border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,35,26,.12);z-index:40}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item.is-open .sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown{display:block}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a{display:block;padding:9px 10px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a:hover,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown a:focus-visible{color:{{ block.settings.hover_color }};background:{{ block.settings.dropdown_hover_background }};outline-offset:2px}
.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:{{ block.settings.action_spacing }}px;flex:0 0 auto}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search input{width:{{ block.settings.search_width }}px;min-width:0;padding:9px 12px;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search button,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-link,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:6px;border:0;color:{{ block.settings.icon_color }};background:transparent;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-link svg,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search svg,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle svg{width:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;stroke:currentColor}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-link:hover,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle:hover{color:{{ block.settings.hover_color }}}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-panel{display:none}
@media(max-width:989px){.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{min-height:{{ block.settings.tablet_height }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo{width:{{ block.settings.logo_width_tablet }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav{gap:{{ block.settings.nav_gap | times: 0.65 }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{font-size:{{ block.settings.nav_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px}}
@media(max-width:749px){.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{min-height:{{ block.settings.mobile_height }}px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo{width:{{ block.settings.logo_width_mobile }}px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-account,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-wishlist{display:none}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle{display:inline-flex}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-panel{padding:8px 16px 18px;border-top:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-panel.is-open{display:block}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item{border-bottom:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item>button,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item>a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;width:100%;padding:12px 4px;border:0;background:none;color:{{ block.settings.nav_color }};font:inherit;text-align:left;text-decoration:none}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-submenu{display:none;padding:0 0 8px 12px}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item.is-open .sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-submenu{display:block}.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-submenu a{display:block;padding:8px 4px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-decoration:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
{% if block.settings.show_logo %}<a class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand" href="{{ block.settings.logo_link | default: routes.root_url }}" aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}">{% if block.settings.logo %}<img class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo" src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: shop.name | escape }}" loading="eager" width="{{ block.settings.logo.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.logo.height }}">{% else %}<span class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand-name">SBL Farms</span>{% endif %}</a>{% endif %}
{% assign nav_titles='Plants|Seeds|Pots|Services|Gifting' | split:'|' %}{% assign menu_keys='plants_menu|seeds_menu|pots_menu|services_menu|gifting_menu' | split:'|' %}
<nav class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav" aria-label="Main navigation">{% for title in nav_titles %}{% assign idx=forloop.index0 %}{% assign menu_key=menu_keys[idx] %}{% assign menu=block.settings[menu_key] %}<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item"><button class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">{{ title }}<svg class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__chevron" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 4 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="{{ block.settings.chevron_stroke }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dropdown">{% if menu != blank %}{% for link in menu.links limit:10 %}<a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title | escape }}</a>{% endfor %}{% else %}<span style="display:block;padding:9px 10px">Choose a menu in block settings</span>{% endif %}</div></div>{% endfor %}{% if block.settings.blog_link != blank %}<a class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.blog_link }}">{{ block.settings.blog_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.contact_link != blank %}<a class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.contact_link }}">{{ block.settings.contact_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</nav>
<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions">{% if block.settings.show_search %}<form class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__search" action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search"><input type="search" name="q" placeholder="{{ block.settings.search_placeholder | escape }}" aria-label="Search store"><button type="submit" aria-label="Search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.8"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg></button></form>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_account %}<a class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-link sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-account" href="{{ routes.account_url }}" aria-label="Account"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M4.5 21a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 15 0"/></svg></a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_wishlist and block.settings.wishlist_link != blank %}<a class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-link sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desktop-wishlist" href="{{ block.settings.wishlist_link }}" aria-label="Wishlist"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M20.8 8.8c0 5.1-8.8 11-8.8 11s-8.8-5.9-8.8-11A4.8 4.8 0 0 1 12 6.1a4.8 4.8 0 0 1 8.8 2.7Z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_cart %}<a class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon-link" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Cart, {{ cart.item_count }} items"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M3 4h2l2.2 11.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.6a2 2 0 0 0 1.9-1.5L21 8H6"/><circle cx="10" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1"/></svg></a>{% endif %}<button class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open menu"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/></svg></button></div>
</div>
<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-panel"><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation">{% for title in nav_titles %}{% assign idx=forloop.index0 %}{% assign menu_key=menu_keys[idx] %}{% assign menu=block.settings[menu_key] %}<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false">{{ title }}<svg class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__chevron" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 4 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="{{ block.settings.chevron_stroke }}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-submenu">{% if menu != blank %}{% for link in menu.links limit:10 %}<a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title | escape }}</a>{% endfor %}{% endif %}</div></div>{% endfor %}{% if block.settings.blog_link != blank %}<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item"><a href="{{ block.settings.blog_link }}">{{ block.settings.blog_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.contact_link != blank %}<div class="sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item"><a href="{{ block.settings.contact_link }}">{{ block.settings.contact_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}</nav></div>
</sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const tag='sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class SblHeader extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.querySelectorAll('.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item>button').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const item=button.closest('.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item');const opening=!item.classList.contains('is-open');this.querySelectorAll('.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item.is-open,.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-nav-item.is-open').forEach(other=>{other.classList.remove('is-open');const trigger=other.querySelector('button');if(trigger)trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')});item.classList.toggle('is-open',opening);button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',opening?'true':'false')}));const toggle=this.querySelector('.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-toggle');const panel=this.querySelector('.sbl-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}__mobile-panel');if(toggle&&panel)toggle.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=toggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',open);toggle.setAttribute('aria-label',open?'Close menu':'Open menu');panel.classList.toggle('is-open',open)});document.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(!this.contains(event.target))this.querySelectorAll('.is-open').forEach(item=>{item.classList.remove('is-open');const button=item.querySelector('button');if(button)button.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')})})}}customElements.define(tag,SblHeader)})();</script>
